sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant Browser
    participant Reports as GET /reports
    participant DB as Shared SQLite
    Manager->>Browser: Select report, inclusive dates and optional hub
    Browser->>Reports: GET with filters and manager credentials
    Reports->>DB: Look up authenticated username's role
    DB-->>Reports: Account role
    alt Missing credentials or account is not a manager
        Reports-->>Browser: 401 or 403
    else Manager authenticated
        Reports->>DB: Read available hubs
        DB-->>Reports: Hub choices
        Reports->>Reports: Validate filters and convert Vietnam dates to UTC
        alt Invalid criteria
            Reports-->>Browser: 400 with filter error
        else Valid criteria
            alt Sales
                Reports->>DB: Select confirmed orders by creation time and hub
            else Hub workload
                Reports->>DB: Count current order statuses by hub and creation time
            else Delivery performance
                Reports->>DB: Count delivery outcomes by hub and outcome time
            end
            DB-->>Reports: Matching records or counts
            Reports-->>Browser: Read-only results or empty state
        end
    end
